Symmetric quantize(x, b, α):
1. m = max(|x|) (per-tensor over the activation tensor, or per-channel over channels).
2. scale s = (α · m) / Q, where for signed symmetric with b bits, Q = 2^(b-1) − 1 (or 2^(b-1)). Use qmax = 2^(b-1) − 1.
3. quant = round(clip(x/s, −qmax, qmax)).
